{"id":404,"frontend_id":404,"title":"Word Search Existence","slug":"word-search-existence","difficulty":"Medium","pattern_category":"strings","tags":["dataset","strings"],"company_tags":["Google","Bloomberg"],"ac_rate":"52.1%","statement":"Given an m x n grid of characters board and a string word, determine if the word exists in the grid. The word can be constructed from letters of sequentially adjacent cells, where adjacent cells are horizontally or vertically neighboring. The same letter cell may not be used more than once.\n   \n   ## Constraints\n   - board[i][j] and word consist of only uppercase and lowercase English letters.\n   - 1 <= word.length <= 15\n   - 1 <= m, n <= 6\n   - n == board[i].length\n   - m == board.length\n\n### Examples\n\n**Example 1:**\n\n**Input:** `board = [[\"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"E\"], [\"S\", \"F\", \"C\", \"S\"], [\"A\", \"D\", \"E\", \"E\"]], word = \"ABCCED\"`\n\n**Output:** `true`\n\n**Example 2:**\n\n**Input:** `board = [[\"A\"]], word = \"A\"`\n\n**Output:** `true`\n","hints":[],"starter_code_python":"class Solution:\n       def solve(self, word: str, board: list) -> bool:\n           # Write your code here\n           def exists(i, j, k):\n               if k == len(word):\n                   return True\n               if i < 0 or i >= len(board) or j < 0 or j >= len(board[0]) or word[k] != board[i][j]:\n                   return False\n               temp = board[i][j]\n               board[i][j] = '#'\n               found = exists(i + 1, j, k + 1) or exists(i - 1, j, k + 1) or exists(i, j + 1, k + 1) or exists(i, j - 1, k + 1)\n               board[i][j] = temp\n               return found\n           for i in range(len(board)):\n               for j in range(len(board[0])):\n                   if exists(i, j, 0):\n                       return True\n           return False","example_test_cases":[{"stdin":"{\"board\": [[\"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"E\"], [\"S\", \"F\", \"C\", \"S\"], [\"A\", \"D\", \"E\", \"E\"]], \"word\": \"ABCCED\"}","expected_stdout":"true","is_hidden":false,"order":0},{"stdin":"{\"board\": [[\"A\"]], \"word\": \"A\"}","expected_stdout":"true","is_hidden":false,"order":1}],"hidden_test_cases":[{"stdin":"{\"board\": [[\"A\", \"B\"], [\"C\", \"D\"]], \"word\": \"ABCD\"}","expected_stdout":"false","is_hidden":true,"order":2},{"stdin":"{\"board\": [[\"A\", \"B\", \"C\"], [\"D\", \"E\", \"F\"], [\"G\", \"H\", \"I\"]], \"word\": \"IEFG\"}","expected_stdout":"false","is_hidden":true,"order":3},{"stdin":"{\"board\": [[\"a\", \"b\", \"c\"], [\"d\", \"e\", \"f\"], [\"g\", \"h\", \"i\"]], \"word\": \"iefg\"}","expected_stdout":"false","is_hidden":true,"order":4},{"stdin":"{\"board\": [[\"A\", \"A\", \"A\", \"A\"], [\"A\", \"A\", \"A\", \"A\"], [\"A\", \"A\", \"A\", \"A\"]], \"word\": \"AAAA\"}","expected_stdout":"true","is_hidden":true,"order":5},{"stdin":"{\"board\": [[\"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"D\", \"E\", \"F\"], [\"G\", \"H\", \"I\", \"J\", \"K\", \"L\"]], \"word\": \"ABCDEF\"}","expected_stdout":"true","is_hidden":true,"order":6},{"stdin":"{\"board\": [[\"X\", \"X\", \"X\", \"X\", \"X\", \"X\"], [\"X\", \"X\", \"X\", \"X\", \"X\", \"X\"]], \"word\": \"XXXXXX\"}","expected_stdout":"true","is_hidden":true,"order":7},{"stdin":"{\"board\": [[\"Z\"], [\"Z\"], [\"Z\"]], \"word\": \"ZZZ\"}","expected_stdout":"true","is_hidden":true,"order":8},{"stdin":"{\"board\": [[\"P\", \"Q\", \"R\"], [\"S\", \"T\", \"U\"], [\"V\", \"W\", \"X\"]], \"word\": \"PQT\"}","expected_stdout":"true","is_hidden":true,"order":9},{"stdin":"{\"board\": [[\"M\", \"N\", \"O\"], [\"P\", \"Q\", \"R\"], [\"S\", \"T\", \"U\"], [\"V\", \"W\", \"X\"], [\"Y\", \"Z\", \"A\"]], \"word\": \"MNOP\"}","expected_stdout":"false","is_hidden":true,"order":10},{"stdin":"{\"board\": [[\"J\", \"K\", \"L\"], [\"M\", \"N\", \"O\"], [\"P\", \"Q\", \"R\"]], \"word\": \"JML\"}","expected_stdout":"false","is_hidden":true,"order":11},{"stdin":"{\"board\": [[\"E\", \"E\", \"E\", \"E\", \"E\", \"E\"], [\"E\", \"E\", \"E\", \"E\", \"E\", \"E\"]], \"word\": \"EEEEEE\"}","expected_stdout":"true","is_hidden":true,"order":12},{"stdin":"{\"board\": [[\"C\", \"C\", \"C\", \"C\"], [\"C\", \"C\", \"C\", \"C\"], [\"C\", \"C\", \"C\", \"C\"], [\"C\", \"C\", \"C\", \"C\"], [\"C\", \"C\", \"C\", \"C\"], [\"C\", \"C\", \"C\", \"C\"]], \"word\": \"CCCCC\"}","expected_stdout":"true","is_hidden":true,"order":13},{"stdin":"{\"board\": [[\"B\", \"B\", \"B\"], [\"B\", \"B\", \"B\"], [\"B\", \"B\", \"B\"]], \"word\": \"BBB\"}","expected_stdout":"true","is_hidden":true,"order":14},{"stdin":"{\"board\": [[\"F\", \"G\", \"H\", \"I\", \"J\", \"K\"], [\"L\", \"M\", \"N\", \"O\", \"P\", \"Q\"]], \"word\": \"FGHIJ\"}","expected_stdout":"true","is_hidden":true,"order":15},{"stdin":"{\"board\": [[\"T\", \"E\", \"A\", \"R\", \"S\"], [\"E\", \"V\", \"E\", \"N\", \"I\"], [\"R\", \"A\", \"I\", \"N\", \"Y\"]], \"word\": \"TEARS\"}","expected_stdout":"true","is_hidden":true,"order":16},{"stdin":"{\"board\": [[\"D\", \"O\", \"G\"], [\"C\", \"A\", \"T\"], [\"B\", \"I\", \"R\", \"D\"]], \"word\": \"CAT\"}","expected_stdout":"true","is_hidden":true,"order":17},{"stdin":"{\"board\": [[\"L\", \"E\", \"A\", \"F\"], [\"E\", \"E\", \"L\", \"S\"], [\"A\", \"R\", \"T\", \"S\"]], \"word\": \"ART\"}","expected_stdout":"true","is_hidden":true,"order":18},{"stdin":"{\"board\": [[\"X\", \"X\", \"X\"], [\"X\", \"O\", \"X\"], [\"X\", \"X\", \"X\"]], \"word\": \"O\"}","expected_stdout":"true","is_hidden":true,"order":19},{"stdin":"{\"board\": [[\"Z\", \"Z\", \"Z\"], [\"Z\", \"Z\", \"Z\"], [\"Z\", \"Z\", \"Z\"]], \"word\": \"ZZZZ\"}","expected_stdout":"true","is_hidden":true,"order":20},{"stdin":"{\"board\": [[\"P\", \"L\", \"A\", \"N\", \"E\"], [\"L\", \"A\", \"K\", \"E\"], [\"A\", \"I\", \"R\", \"P\"]], \"word\": \"LAKE\"}","expected_stdout":"true","is_hidden":true,"order":21},{"stdin":"{\"board\": [[\"C\", \"A\", \"T\", \"S\"], [\"D\", \"O\", \"G\", \"S\"], [\"B\", \"I\", \"R\", \"D\"], [\"F\", \"I\", \"S\", \"H\"]], \"word\": \"CATSDOGS\"}","expected_s